full-query: "You have just been assigned to take care of the Automated resources which have been setup by your company in AWS. You are looking at integrating some of the company's chef recipes to be used for the existing Opswork stacks already setup in AWS. But when you go to the recipes section, you cannot see the option to add any recipes. What could be the reason for this?"
